WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:04.970
Thorium itself as a metal is quite frisky
and if you heat it in air it burns

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:11.780
incredibly intensely. It’s also a component
of lenses for cameras because

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:15.769
when it’s mixed in with certain other elements
to give you these lenses,

00:00:15.769 --> 00:00:20.330
it has a very high refractive index and a
very low dispersion, which

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:24.180
means you get really sharp images; possibly
in the lens that you’re

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:25.579
filming me with right now.

